# Headless tour of partitions (cargo xtask sim-smoke): the critical panel (left, partition 0)
# and the media panel (right, partition 1). A tap focuses the right panel; every fault key then
# goes to it, and the left panel keeps updating with no fault.
wait 100
shot start
wait 16
tap 250 60
wait 50
key 1
wait 200
shot effect_loop
key 2
wait 200
shot flood
key 3
wait 300
shot slow
key 4
wait 200
shot fail_safe
key 5
wait 300
shot stalled
